  "Software Details": "Yazılım Detayları",
  "The Duo2FA Integration in eCommerceGo SaaS introduces an additional layer of security, ensuring that both admins and users are protected from unauthorized access. This module leverages the trusted Duo Two-Factor Authentication (2FA) system to provide a robust security solution. By incorporating Duo2FA, eCommerceGo enhances the overall security framework, safeguarding sensitive data and user accounts with minimal effort.": "eCommerceGo SaaS'taki Duo2FA Entegrasyonu, hem yöneticilerin hem de kullanıcıların yetkisiz erişime karşı korunmasını sağlayan ek bir güvenlik katmanı sunar. ",
  "Easy Configuration with Required IDs": "Gerekli Kimliklerle Kolay Yapılandırma",
  "Setting up the Duo2FA module in eCommerceGo SaaS is straightforward. Administrators need to add the required IDs for both the admin and user accounts. This initial configuration is quick and user-friendly, ensuring that businesses can implement enhanced security measures without extensive technical knowledge. The simple setup process allows businesses to promptly benefit from the added security without disrupting their operations.": "eCommerceGo SaaS'ta Duo2FA modülünün kurulumu basittir. ",
  "Secure Admin and User Logins": "Güvenli Yönetici ve Kullanıcı Girişleri",
  "Once the Duo2FA module is configured, both admins and users will be prompted to enter a unique authentication code upon logging in. This two-step verification process ensures that only authorized individuals can access the platform. By requiring an additional code, which is typically sent to a user’s mobile device, the risk of unauthorized access is significantly reduced. This added layer of security is crucial for protecting sensitive business and customer data.": "Duo2FA modülü yapılandırıldıktan sonra, hem yöneticilerden hem de kullanıcılardan oturum açtıklarında benzersiz bir kimlik doğrulama kodu girmeleri istenecektir. Bu iki adımlı doğrulama süreci, yalnızca yetkili kişilerin platforma erişebilmesini sağlar. ",
  "Enhanced Protection Against Unauthorized Access": "Yetkisiz Erişime Karşı Gelişmiş Koruma",
  "The Duo2FA integration provides enhanced protection against unauthorized access and potential security breaches. With cyber threats becoming increasingly sophisticated, traditional password-based authentication methods are no longer sufficient. Duo2FA ensures that even if a password is compromised, unauthorized users will not be able to access the system without the second authentication factor. This dual-layered security approach is essential for maintaining the integrity of your eCommerce platform.": "Duo2FA entegrasyonu, yetkisiz erişime ve olası güvenlik ihlallerine karşı gelişmiş koruma sağlar. ",
